title: 주2_화_1교시_정문_서은표_영문
---
(The uphill climb to school is always exhausting.)
<<show pyo_idle>>
(As I struggle up the stairs, I see the back of EunPyo up ahead.)
(EunPyo is busy moving some boxes.)
{name()}: EunPyo!
(When I call her name, EunPyo looks back.)
<<play pyo_sound>>
EunPyo: Oh, {name()}!
EunPyo: Hey.
<<if get("str") >= 3>>
    <<choice 주2_화_1교시_정문_서은표_긍1_영문 "Need some help?" 주2_화_1교시_정문_서은표_부1_영문 "What are you moving?">>
    (The boxes must be heavy; beads of sweat are forming on EunPyo's forehead.)
<<else>>
    (The boxes must be heavy; beads of sweat are forming on EunPyo's forehead.)
    <<jump 주2_화_1교시_정문_서은표_근력부족_영문>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 주2_화_1교시_정문_서은표_긍1_영문
---
{name()}: What are you moving? Need some help?
{name()}: Give one to me.
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +10>>
<<show pyo_smile>>
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: Oh, I'd really appreciate that!
<<jump 주2_화_1교시_정문_서은표_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주2_화_1교시_정문_서은표_부1_영문
---
{name()}: What are you moving?
EunPyo: These are things for the club room.
EunPyo: I somehow ended up being the one to move them...
<<play 서은표_흠>>
EunPyo: Do you think you could carry just this one for me?
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +10>>
{name()}: Uh, sure.
<<jump 주2_화_1교시_정문_서은표_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주2_화_1교시_정문_서은표_분기1_영문
---
(I took a box from EunPyo.)
(It's heavier than I expected, but manageable.)
{name()}: Where should I take this?
EunPyo: Just to the club room.
<<bg 낮_동아리방>>
(We moved the boxes to the club room.)
EunPyo: Thanks for coming with me.
<<show pyo_blush>>
EunPyo: Someone had to do it...
EunPyo: So I volunteered since I had some free time.
{name()}: You worked hard.
<<show pyo_smile>>
EunPyo: Well, it's good exercise... no big deal.
EunPyo: I have to go let them know everything's been moved...
EunPyo: You know we have class together next period, right?
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: See you in the lecture hall!
(EunPyo says goodbye and leaves the club room.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주2_화_1교시_정문_서은표_근력부족_영문
---
{name()}: What are you moving? Need some help?
(EunPyo glanced at me briefly.)
<<show pyo_smile>>
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: No, it's okay. I can move them by myself!
(She has a somewhat determined look on her face.)
EunPyo: I'm stronger than I look, you know.
{name()}: Where are you moving them to?
<<choice 주2_화_1교시_정문_서은표_긍2_영문 "Sure, I was heading to the club room anyway." 주2_화_1교시_정문_서은표_부2_영문 "I actually have to go somewhere else...">>
EunPyo: The club room. Want to go together?
===

title: 주2_화_1교시_정문_서은표_긍2_영문
---
<<like 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo +10>>
{name()}: Sure, I was heading to the club room anyway.
<<bg 낮_동아리방>>
(We chatted as we arrived at the club room together.)
<<play 공통_쾅>>
(EunPyo set the box down with a heavy thud.)
<<jump 주2_화_1교시_정문_서은표_운반후_영문>>
===

title: 주2_화_1교시_정문_서은표_부2_영문
---
<<dislike 서은표>>
<<change lvPyo -5>>
{name()}: I actually have to go somewhere else...
<<show pyo_neg>>
EunPyo: Oh, really? Well then...
EunPyo: You know we have class together next period, right?
<<show pyo_smile>>
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: See you in the lecture hall!
(EunPyo says goodbye and disappears toward the club room.)
<<end>>
===

title: 주2_화_1교시_정문_서은표_운반후_영문
---
EunPyo: Thanks for coming with me.
<<show pyo_blush>>
{name()}: No problem.
{name()}: How did you end up moving this all by yourself?
EunPyo: Someone had to do it...
EunPyo: So I volunteered since I had some free time.
{name()}: You worked hard.
<<show pyo_smile>>
<<play 서은표_웃음>>
EunPyo: Well, it's good exercise... no big deal.
EunPyo: I have to go let them know everything's been moved...
EunPyo: You know we have class together next period, right?
EunPyo: See you in the lecture hall!
(EunPyo says goodbye and leaves the club room.)
<<end>>
===